SUMMARY:Upstairs at Helium: Justin Smith
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Justin Smith \, an Oklahoma native with a sweet\, religious mot
 her and a law-bending\, pool-hustling father\, discovered his love for come
 dy while studying at a Christian college. He honed his craft in the Oklahom
 a oil fields before moving to NYC where he spent years performing on every 
 stage he could find. Known for his clean\, relatable humor\, Justin’s act
  resonates with everyone—from pastors to those on parole. His impressive 
 credits include appearances on Live from Zanies on The Circle Network\, per
 formances at the Apollo Theater in Harlem and the Kennedy Center in DC\, gu
 est podcast on The Nateland Podcast\, XM's The Bonfire\, host of his own po
 dcast\, ’10 Items or Less’. Always on the move\, Justin tours nationwid
 e\, whether opening for Nate Bargatze or headlining his own shows.\n\nAs on
 e YouTube comment put him\, "A theology educated standup comedian with a fa
 ther who dabbled in organized crime is what I've waited my whole life for!
 ”\n\nPLEASE NOTE: our Upstairs showroom is 21+ and is NOT wheelchair acce
 ssible.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering
